This project reuses the FAIRGAME framework (Apache License 2.0), included under
FAIRGAME/ with modifications; see FAIRGAME/LICENSE and FAIRGAME/NOTICE.md.

The AI Race environment is an independent LLM adaptation of the research paradigm
described by Fernández Domingos and Han (2026), arXiv:2607.26034. The focal source
paper and the project-authored research note are retained under references/papers/.
Third-party paper content remains subject to its original rights and licence.
